      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Now that I think about it, maybe it'd be better to just have the 'Ctr-A' function replace the new 'clear all' button entirely?\n\nIf there's a Ctrl-A/'select all' button, it essentially acts as both a 'copy all' and 'clear all' button depending on if you hit 'copy' or 'backspace' after it. That way the behaviour basically mirrors how physical keyboard shortcuts function in this context.\n\nThis is basically how I was already executing a 'clear all' before this update.\n\nI'd personally much rather have this than the new 'clear all' button.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
