      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey there. Selecting-all on focus was a setting that we disabled on text fields since it was common for players to be typing something, misclick, then accidentally clear what they were typing.\n\nAs a compromise, I've added the ability to triple-click text within the keyboard text field to select-all. This gesture is well-established on just about every computer text selection system, so hopefully this feels natural after a little muscle memory adjusting!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
