      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fb6a3e468f6302c666d0b9c|full_name}: Thank you!! I was going to suggest triple clicking as an alternative for the same reasons but never got around to commenting. That works perfectly, especially since the previous method required a couple clicks anyway. Thanks!",
