  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-01-31T01:55:04.043Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I don't know about other chatbox users, but being able to quickly select my entire message by clicking outside the input field and clicking back inside was **really** valuable to me for quickly copying messages I've already written to queue them up if the timing isn't right.\n\nTo clarify, prior to 1400 you used to be able to click outside the input field, (ie: over the \"characters remaining\" text) and click back into the input field. Doing this would essentially act as a 'Ctrl-A' for what is inside the input field.\n\nThis behaviour is no longer possible on 1400 due to some chatbox input field changes. I would really appreciate if a solution was implemented. I really valued being able to have a 'Ctrl+A' function in VR.",
